<title>UK: Smithkline Beecham sets 10 bln yen six-year bond.</title>
<headline>Smithkline Beecham sets 10 bln yen six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nikko.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SMITHKLINE BEECHAM CAPITAL PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SMITHKLINE BEECHAM PLC</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     1.96	MATURITY    19.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.30    PAY DATE    19.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> TAX PROVS  STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>		UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
